==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Whiskingmeister]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Any anti-Angel unit will help here. If one owns [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] or a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]], this stage becomes pretty much trivial. Just spam the Ramen for damage and/or the Sanzo for the slow debuff and it should be an easy clear. You can also use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to take advantage of the Whiskingmeister's Knockback, and get in tons of damage quickly.

